# The build stamp an installer must check before overwriting anything.
#
# On 22 September an installer from the day before was double-clicked a
# second time. It happily put back an older kalshibot/journal.py, the
# reduce-only clamp lost the method it depends on, and the protection went
# away without a word. Only the startup check noticed.
#
# Every installer from now on compares its own payload date against the
# first line of this file and refuses to run if it is older.
